SUMMARY:Model Mondays - Spotlight On: MAI Models
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nAt Microsoft Build\, we announced a
  family of seven new models developed in-house at Microsoft AI. These mode
 ls form a new multimodal ecosystem designed to work across a variety of re
 al-world tasks - with models to support image\, voice\, transcription\, co
 ding\, and reasoning.\n\nJoin us as we talk to the Microsoft AI models tea
 m about what's new in the MAI family\, how this works under the hood\, and
  what we can do to use them more effectively for building AI agents.\n\n**
 *\n\n🔎 [Explore the Resources](https://github.com/microsoft/model-monda
 ys)\n\n📢 [Join the conversation on Discord!](https://aka.ms/model-monda
 ys/discord)\n\n📖 [Read the Newsletter](https://aka.ms/model-mondays/new
 sletter)\n\n📌 This session is a part of the Model Mondays series. [Lear
 n more here!](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1485/?wt.mc
 _id=meetup_27393_webpage_reactor)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3158
 65785/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260727T221413Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260727T221413Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
