SUMMARY:Model Mondays - Cohere for Agentic AI: Models\, Demos\, and the Pa
 th to Optimized 
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nJoin us for a hands-on tour of Cohe
 re's model family and how each piece fits into building optimized agentic 
 experiences.\n\nWe'll cover Command A for reasoning and native tool-use\, 
 Embed 4 for multimodal retrieval\, and Rerank for precision search\, then 
 show how they combine in real agent workflows\n\nLive demos throughout wil
 l show each model in action and how to pair them for production-ready agen
 ts.\n\n***\n\n* [Explore the Resources](https://github.com/microsoft/model
 -mondays)\n* [Read the Newsletter](https://aka.ms/model-mondays/newsletter
 )\n* [Continue the conversation on the Discord](https://aka.ms/model-monda
 ys/discord)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3159
 94891/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260805T222531Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T222531Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
