SUMMARY:Skill Up: Adding Skills to Your Agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nDiscover how Skills can extend Decl
 arative Agents in Microsoft 365 Copilot with new capabilities\, actions\, 
 and knowledge tailored to your business scenarios.\n\nJoin the product tea
 m as they demonstrate how to design more capable and useful agents with Sk
 ills.\n\n-------------------------------------------\n[**Copilot Developer
  Camp**](https://aka.ms/copilotdevcamp)\n📍 [Learn more about the series
 ](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1696/?wt.mc_id=meetup_2
 7447_webpage_reactor)
