DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260818T150000
SUMMARY:Practical path to build AI-ready application on App Service
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nMost modernization projects don't s
 tall because of technology. They stall because real-world applications dep
 end on things that are difficult to rebuild: custom software\, legacy depe
 ndencies\, specialized configurations\, and years of accumulated business 
 logic.\n\nIn this session\, we'll examine how to modernize existing applic
 ations with less disruption\, reduce migration risk\, and prepare workload
 s for the next generation of AI-powered experiences. Modernization isn't t
 he finish line—it's what makes AI possible.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3154
 15492/
